        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-175" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;GPU bubble 就是在 GPU compute 的轨道上出现空白的区域，即没有 kernel 执行&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="670" x="7840" y="1625" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-180" edge="1" parent="1" source="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-177" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-179" value="">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-182" edge="1" parent="1" source="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-177" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-181">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-193" edge="1" parent="1" source="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-177" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-187">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-177" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;一般我的思路是从整体到局部进行分析&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="370" x="7840" y="1720" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-179" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;分为 CPU 上的数据处理和 GPU 上的模型计算两部分，这两个部分分别可能出现瓶颈&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="730" x="8320" y="1720" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-189" edge="1" parent="1" source="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-181" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-183">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-190" edge="1" parent="1" source="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-181" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-185">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-191" edge="1" parent="1" source="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-181" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-186">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-192" edge="1" parent="1" source="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-181" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-188">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-181" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;在分析 GPU 时，我们通过 Nsys 打印 timeline, 找到最大的 GPU bubble，通过观察其前后确定是哪种瓶颈&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="410" x="8320" y="1810" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-183" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;数据传输瓶颈（GPU等数据）： GPU 空闲，前后有 memcpy 和 memset、pageed memcpy&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="760" x="8930" y="1810" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-185" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;GPU等CPU：CPU 端未及时发起 kernel GPU 空闲，CPU 侧正在执行其他任务&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="630" x="8930" y="1900" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-186" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;GPU等待同步完成： CPU 发起同步，GPU 等待，导致空闲，Timeline 上有同步 API 调用&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="720" x="8930" y="1995" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-187" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;确认是哪种计算瓶颈后，我们再确认是那块代码，我们通过观察前后的计算算子，并在模型中增加更多的 nvtx 染色，以及不同 block 间的 sycn 操作，使得 timeline 更加准确，最终确认性能较差的代码片段进行分析。&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="800" x="8320" y="2210" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-188" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;GPU内部流相互依赖等待：多个 kernel 有依赖导致 Timeline 上不同流有相互等待&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="650" x="8930" y="2100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-197" edge="1" parent="1" source="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-194" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-196">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-198" edge="1" parent="1" source="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-194" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-195">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-194" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;如何确定 communication 和 computation 是否 overlap&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="470" x="7840" y="2360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-195" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;如何实现重叠，cudaMemcpyAsyc 和多 streams 可以更好的实现重叠。&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="610" x="8400" y="2450" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-196" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;对于整体的我们可以通过计算模型整体的重叠率&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="440" x="8400" y="2360" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-204" edge="1" parent="1" source="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-200" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-201">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-206" edge="1" parent="1" source="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-200" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-205">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-219" edge="1" parent="1" source="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-200" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-216">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-200" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;h3 id=&quot;h_678602674_40&quot; data-into-catalog-status=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 1.1em; line-height: 1.5; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: calc(1.90909em) 0px calc(1.27273em); clear: left; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Nsys 中如何分析 Python GIL 的影响&lt;/h3&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="267" x="7443" y="2560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-203" edge="1" parent="1" source="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-201" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-202">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-201" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;核心思路是通过分析时间线中的线程同步等待函数（如 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: rgb(248, 248, 250); border-radius: 3px; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Andale Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;lucida console&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0px 2px; padding: 3px 4px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); text-align: start;&quot;&gt;pthread_cond_timedwait&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;）来间接识别 GIL 导致的延迟&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="823" x="7797" y="2560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-202" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;因为 GIL 本身就是一种互斥锁机制&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="300" x="8710" y="2560" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-205" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;阻塞时，在 Nsys 的时间线（Timeline）上，该线程通常会显示为在执行如 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: rgb(248, 248, 250); border-radius: 3px; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Andale Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;lucida console&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0px 2px; padding: 3px 4px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); text-align: start;&quot;&gt;pthread_cond_timedwait&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; 或 &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;background-color: rgb(248, 248, 250); border-radius: 3px; font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, &amp;quot;Andale Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;lucida console&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Courier New&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; margin: 0px 2px; padding: 3px 4px; color: rgb(25, 27, 31); text-align: start;&quot;&gt;pthread_mutex_lock&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(25, 27, 31); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Source Han Sans SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;WenQuanYi Micro Hei&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;MiSans L3&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: start; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; 等系统调用。&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="1023" x="7797" y="2670" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-209" edge="1" parent="1" source="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-207" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="_0BZuxCClw2ciHlogpHv-208">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
